  nonce: e9d8  # e9d8
  message: "Pass 36 (continuing 06022026_1622) cross-codebase reach + decomposition of pass-35 F35.A1.\n\nF36.C2 (gitignore writer activation is grammar-files-present-conditional): pass-35 F35.A1's 4321 violations (markdown 4243 + gitignore 78) decompose differently across codebases. On tracker-pkg with --include-docs, 102/102 violations are markdown id_format only. The 78 gitignore violations from root are ABSENT — tracker-pkg has no .gitignore files in its scope, so gitignore writer doesn't fire. Markdown-violation ratio 102/4243 = 2.4% vs substrate-size ratio 5055/37816 = 13.4% suggests markdown writer fires more file-count-proportionally than gitignore writer. F35.A1's pass-35 fix-path ('mirror INV-sugat Phase 6 mainstream-analyzer sweep on doc/config analyzer set') is reaffirmed cross-codebase: same 3 sub-mechanisms (gitignore id-as-stable-id reuse, markdown section unsanitized colons, markdown code_block literal 'code' span segment) — markdown sweep is universal coverage, gitignore sweep affects smaller subset of codebases."  # e9d8
